<view class="page">
  <view class="section">学年</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新主席</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>部门 / 部长</text>
      <picker
        mode="multiSelector"
        range="{{chairmanRange}}"
        value="{{chairmanValue}}"
        bindcolumnchange="onChairmanColumn"
        bindchange="onChairmanChange"
      >
        <view class="cascader">{{chairmanText}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointChairman">任命为主席</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新部长</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>部门 / 小干</text>
      <picker
        mode="multiSelector"
        range="{{ministerRange}}"
        value="{{ministerValue}}"
        bindcolumnchange="onMinisterColumn"
        bindchange="onMinisterChange"
      >
        <view class="cascader">{{ministerText}} ›</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointMinister">任命为部长</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    先选部门，再选该部门的成员：主席从部长中任命，部长从小干中任命；任命后会向对方发送站内消息。学年切换只改统计口径，不会删除历史数据。
  </view>
</view>
